<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

    <%- include("../partials/head", {title: "Privacy Policy"}) %>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/legal.css">

</head>

<body>

<%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

<main class="legal-container">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="updated">
        Last updated: August 2026
    </p>

    <section>

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe respects your privacy and is committed to protecting
            the personal information you provide when using our website.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
            When you create an account, we may collect information such
            as:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your name</li>
            <li>Your email address</li>
            <li>Your encrypted password</li>
            <li>Account and premium status information</li>
            <li>Quiz and website activity associated with your account</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            We may also collect technical information necessary to
            operate and secure the website.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

        <p>We may use your information to:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Create and manage your account.</li>
            <li>Provide access to EconoMe services.</li>
            <li>Verify your email address.</li>
            <li>Provide premium content that you have purchased.</li>
            <li>Communicate with you about your account.</li>
            <li>Improve website functionality and security.</li>
            <li>Prevent fraud and abuse.</li>
        </ul>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>4. Passwords</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe does not intentionally store your password in plain
            text. Passwords are securely hashed before being stored.
        </p>

        <p>
            You should never share your password with another person.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>5. Email Communication</h2>

        <p>
            We may send emails necessary to operate your account,
            including account verification and important account
            notifications.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>6. Payments</h2>

        <p>
            Payments are processed through Paddle. Payment information
            such as card details is handled by the payment provider
            rather than being stored directly in the EconoMe database.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>7. Cookies and Sessions</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe may use cookies or session technologies to keep users
            authenticated and maintain necessary website functionality.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>8. Data Security</h2>

        <p>
            We take reasonable measures to protect account information
            from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
        </p>

        <p>
            However, no internet-based service can guarantee absolute
            security.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>9. Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
            EconoMe may use third-party services for hosting, payments,
            email delivery, analytics, or other website functionality.
            These services may process information according to their
            own privacy policies.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>10. Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
            We retain account information for as long as reasonably
            necessary to provide our services, comply with legal
            obligations, resolve disputes, and maintain security.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>11. Your Rights</h2>

        <p>
            Depending on applicable law, you may have rights regarding
            your personal information, including requesting access,
            correction, or deletion of your information.
        </p>

        <p>
            To make a request, please contact us through our
            <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>

        <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy when necessary. Changes
            will be published on this page.
        </p>

    </section>

</main>

</body>

</html>